per insegnanti","overview":"Benjamin, dottorando senza borsa di studio, accetta una cattedra a contratto in un college. Senza formazione né esperienza, di fronte a un'istituzione indebolita, scopre le difficoltà di questa professione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"A Real Job","overview":"Benjamin is a PhD student without scholarship support. Under the pressure of his parents, and in need of money, he becomes a substitute teacher in a middle school. Without training nor experience, and facing a declining public educational system, he discovers how tough this job can be. Hopefully, his supportive and committed colleagues will lead him to take a fresh look at the profession."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"C’est la rentrée. Une nouvelle année scolaire au collège qui voit se retrouver Pierre, Meriem, Fouad, Sophie, Sandrine, Léo et Sofiane, un groupe d'enseignants engagés et soudés. Ils sont vite rejoints par Benjamin, jeune professeur remplaçant sans expérience et rapidement confronté aux affres du métier. À leur contact, il va découvrir combien la passion de l’enseignement demeure vivante au sein d’une institution pourtant fragilisée."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aK9Pv7oRAzRfEQs6rvYBu1XpnZy.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vaVr73LwlYEe5Mj4tXXXATePeNu.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":934506,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aK9Pv7oRAzRfEQs6rvYBu1XpnZy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aK9Pv7oRAzRfEQs6rvYBu1XpnZy.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1201},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aK9Pv7oRAzRfEQs6rvYBu1XpnZy.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aK9Pv7oRAzRfEQs6rvYBu1XpnZy.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"he